  <item>
    <title>印象深刻！原来我有过这样的旅行经历</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6658838fad5aa5d8c282afd0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6658838fad5aa5d8c282afd0</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 May 2024 13:47:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>暑期将至，大家即将迎来旅行高峰。橘子和旺旺前段时间分享了彼此的旅游经历，竟然发现这些故事发生得都不可思议却又...合理。那就一起来听听年少轻狂的她们到底在旅游途中经历过哪些神奇的事情吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>不无聊进度条指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a>旺旺的2个童年旅行记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="352">05:52</a>一个人的旅行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="441">07:21</a>独自旅行专业户-橘子</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="877">14:37</a>第二次台湾行依旧有惊喜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a>意大利小镇的奇妙经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">19:39</a>靠脚走的京都行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1346">22:26</a>新加坡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1513">25:13</a>旺旺穷游德国的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a>橘子东南亚穷受苦记</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2494">41:34</a>难忘的南非经历</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltEYT_EeTthZbdPpPziDjUfxXVIS.m4a" length="46773880" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:48:12</itunes:duration>
