  <item>
    <title>浪姐5/2024，我终于乘上了这趟风。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6645a73e82b428eafdfbeb69</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6645a73e82b428eafdfbeb69</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 May 2024 06:27:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>很久没有追过星的旺旺，最近陷入了浪姐5的大浪里。拉着橘子开心追姐姐。</span></p><span></span><p><span>刚刚看完二公，分享欲满满。乘着一股热乎劲，在地下车库直接开录。</span></p><span></span><p><span>30几位姐姐，有期待，有惊喜，也有…………</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 期期浪姐都不落，期期只看开场秀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="207">03:27</a> 橘子的前几期浪姐喜爱舞台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="585">09:45</a>旺旺夹带私货—安利近几年最爱的校园剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">14:06</a> 浪5姐姐们的初印象及初舞台大盘点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2186">36:26</a> 浪5一公：《发如雪》获两票《有你在》《不该》也很爱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> 浪5二公：刚刚看完的二公，有惊喜！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3180">53:00</a>最爱的“春秋大梦”组</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3593">59:53</a> 小彩蛋—陈昊宇姐姐小考古</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltZqPZoYCcPnYO_EtKzQqleiC4q-.m4a" length="60009600" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:50</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuzyvZO4mO0zZ-DkKFjBQnhi1Sre.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
