  <item>
    <title>都市逃离计划|静于大理，动在长沙</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662912c4ff598d65f2000031</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662912c4ff598d65f2000031</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Apr 2024 08:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，欢迎来到不无聊指南。</span></p><span></span><p><span>短暂休息，我们...又出发啦！带着爸妈家庭出游的旺旺，和心心念念终于解锁理想城市的橘子，旅途过程中到底发生了什么趣事呢？又有哪些美食美景让橘子旺旺赞不绝口？让咱们一听为快！</span></p><span></span><p><span>从大理到长沙，不无聊进度条参考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:47</a> 橘子和旺旺的大理记忆&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 大理古城-杨记饵块</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="785">13:05</a> 大理古城-北门市场：玉米大叔的玉米汁，九嬢稀豆粉，耙肉饵丝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> 大理古城-向月球飞去西餐厅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1335">22:15</a> 环洱海-从海西逛到海东</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1595">26:35</a> 双廊古镇-山里家人野生菌火锅；隔壁桌母女旅游吵架大赏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">33:12</a> 双廊古镇-乳扇坨坨大挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2482">41:22</a> 长沙初印象&amp;风大雨大橘子洲头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3018">50:18</a> 北门饭店-酸辣三嫩，馓子肉炒肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3190">53:10</a> 笨萝卜-酸萝卜肚丝，紫苏田螺肉...（还有好多好多）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3333">55:33</a> 聚味翟记-特色小龙虾，蒜蓉罗氏虾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3456">57:36</a> 长沙嗦粉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3520">58:40</a> 长沙臭豆腐-白臭豆腐，黑色经典</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3670">01:01:10</a> 长沙好好喝之茶颜悦色，鸳央咖啡，古德墨柠</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3980">01:06:20</a> 湖南省博物馆半日游&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>大波照片来袭！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>1. 杨记饵块</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpe6YvmbkjD6XyTTovAZfcNcsdo_.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>2. 北门市场：玉米大叔的玉米汁，九嬢稀豆粉，耙肉饵丝</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsYKT0QA2f4PzxScqR9Zjpy2JNS6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>3. 向月球飞去</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkgoLwK-uj4ulXl7sDSqAmtwhBCu.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>4. 环洱海（海西）生态走廊随手一拍</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lrpA-rVu5oOZRYqweDUMW1-n_FkL.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>5. 山里家人野生菌火锅</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkg1vGnRtEpfyaHMlzwjliAJN9eg.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>6. 乳扇坨坨</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrKlV4GOVL-gHU3Yg2_xbNrr5gpZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>7. 北门饭店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhTksXbAe_EwaYZz381Wyaz5ydll.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>8. 笨萝卜</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loyoh1tJqbUoK_ejrFsUrVRPs7PQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>9. 小龙虾汇总</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loQhdodMXyc6qzBrO1m5noAX5NRX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>10. 嗦粉汇总</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luteByyKt03dusw13ZUmaOo5g_qt.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>11. 黑&amp;白臭豆腐</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ll3rUhXqqZ9O3JORy2dG1ct507LB.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>12. 茶颜悦色和鸳央咖啡，古德墨柠居然忘拍了！！！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn9ioPqix5JVQIpNMl9R4yEX_c4p.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu-ifVr62IPpGXm5cXm75TX5d8Cc.m4a" length="66922526" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:08:57</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZrbjFXQjAwU0M3ZHI5ZmtraUZEQ1dJdEduWXAucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>谁还不曾是个小屁孩呢？！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6612870e4f66d1c1da8da1c8</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6612870e4f66d1c1da8da1c8</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Apr 2024 08:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>某一天橘子和旺旺闲聊到童年趣事，不自觉地对彼此童年发出感叹“你这...也太皮了吧！”</span></p><span></span><p><span>于是，独乐乐不如众乐乐。我们索性录制一期节目，和大家一起回忆自己熊孩子时期的捣蛋往事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>不无聊进度条参考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a> 大同小异的近视之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 有“味道”的肠胃炎故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="724">12:04</a> 课堂整蛊系列之老师对不起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1091">18:11</a> 笔芯漏墨事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1290">21:30</a> “已阅”欺骗事件之妈妈我考差了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1498">24:58</a> 看电视斗智斗勇系列故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1895">31:35</a> 我是Tony 我为自己剪发</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2041">34:01</a> 童年整蛊/犯傻事件盘点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2785">46:25</a> 我和蝌蚪有个约会</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ljf4DZdKxFJPomKTcFZ9tFWaT4Zk.m4a" length="48429936" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:49:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FleqeJQ9k_wZ3lVSFn7TZ6xGxTrM.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>都市逃离计划|汉中</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/660d244a4f66d1c1dada3748</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">660d244a4f66d1c1dada3748</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Apr 2024 08:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，欢迎来到不无聊指南。我们...出发啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>热爱（请假）出游的旺旺和橘子，趁着小长假来了一趟说走就走的旅行。汉中-作为中国历史名城之一，无论是文化背景还是美食方面，都十分令人期待。</span></p><span></span><p><span>远离熟悉的生活环境，来一场味觉视觉的新奇大冒险，这对于打工人来说也太幸福了吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span>不无聊进度条参考</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a> &nbsp;前进路夜市-张明富面皮-热面皮，牛奶醪糟；摊摊烧烤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="679">11:19</a> 酒店楼下宵夜摊-宁强麻辣鸡，炒粉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1103">18:23</a> 陈家铺镇麻辣香面皮-热面皮，杂酱面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1253">20:53</a> 金明包子-招牌包子，虾仁马蹄包，薄皮素包子，麻辣米线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 核桃馍，一个贝果</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1775">29:35</a> 叁宝烤肉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2053">34:13</a> 兴汉胜境半日游</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2791">46:31</a> 江汉湿地公园</span></p><span></span><p><span>照片一：铺满酱料的汉中炸酱面可太绝了</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvDM2v-wM5m_u59g6N-adBc43iSf.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>照片二：橘子一口气炫11个的金明包子！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsCKYvc4mAV6klY5Oe3R7anXhFxV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>照片三：兴汉胜境大殿里让人印象深刻的地毯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lpyU87OWi8oRBbjAoM3zTDs1zG3p.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>照片四：随手一拍就是欧洲风情的张骞风情街</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkhfu39A9DMFW6es1Cz9oavXcvNC.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
